I see two most impactful transformations that we could implement right now:

Lambda lifting in let expressions
ex: transforming let a = (foo a (bar b)) into let a = (@a @b (foo a (bar b)) a b)).
Note that this doesn't always make terms smaller, so some extra care is needed.

